  "description": "The native payload for Agora's video enhancement extension (clear-vision 4.6.4 on Maven Central), packaged for .NET for Android. The image-quality filters: low-light enhancement, video denoising, colour enhancement and the face-beautification options. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Android or Net.Agora.Voice.Android — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is RtcEngine.SetLowlightEnhanceOptions / SetVideoDenoiserOptions / SetColorEnhanceOptions / SetBeautyEffectOptions in the RTC binding.",
